@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 38
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Developer" as Dev
participant "Trace UI" as UI
participant "Work Item\nAnalysis" as WI
participant "Azure DevOps\nWork Item API" as ADO

Dev -> UI: Start work item dependency analysis
UI -> WI: Request dependency exploration
WI -> ADO: Read work item and links
ADO --> WI: Work item relationship data
WI -> ADO: Resolve related pull request links
ADO --> WI: Additional related artifacts
WI --> UI: Consolidated related dependency view
UI --> Dev: Visualize dependency map
@enduml
